§ `Plots`
DECLARE Tenure IS ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger
DECLARE Plot HAS tenure IS A Tenure

§ `Roles`
DECLARE Tenure IS ONE OF Owner, Manager
DECLARE Post HAS tenure IS A Tenure

§ `Use`
GIVEN p IS A Plot
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`owned` p MEANS p's tenure EQUALS Owner

GIVEN t IS A Tenure
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`bare` t MEANS t EQUALS Owner

#EVAL `owned` (Plot WITH tenure IS Owner)
